### 1. Duplicate category name (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NAME_OF_CATEGORY_A"
}

### 2. Rename a category to an existing name (expect 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/categories/ID_OF_CATEGORY_B
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NAME_OF_CATEGORY_A"
}

### Delete a category that still has products (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/categories/1
